wav2vec 2.0 Base, fine-tuned on 960 h of LibriSpeech: ONNX conversion

The model weights are the wav2vec 2.0 Base + 960 h LibriSpeech CTC checkpoint published by Facebook AI Research
in fairseq (https://github.com/facebookresearch/fairseq/tree/main/examples/wav2vec) under the MIT License,
Copyright (c) Facebook, Inc. and its affiliates, and redistributed by torchaudio as the bundle
torchaudio.pipelines.WAV2VEC2_ASR_BASE_960H under the same licence. The full licence text is in LICENSE.

The ONNX conversion (the export to ONNX described in README.md) is ours.

The alternative release wav2vec2-large-lv60k-960h-v1 is converted from the fairseq wav2vec 2.0 Large LV-60k
+ 960 h LibriSpeech checkpoint, under the same MIT License and copyright.
